#: buildVars.py:15
msgid "freeAudio: Radio and more"
msgstr "自由之声：广播和更多"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on
#: buildVars.py:19
msgid ""
"freeAudio is an internet radio, podcast, audio-book, and local music add-on "
"for NVDA that provides seamless access to thousands of internet radio "
"stations via the Radio Browser open directory, RSS/Atom podcast feeds, the "
"libriVox + GETEM digital library for the visually impaired, and your own "
"local audio files and folders through its built-in jukebox. It features a "
"fully accessible station browser with search, country filter, favourites "
"management, and per-station, per-podcast, per-audio-book, and per-jukebox-"
"track audio profiles. Podcast episodes, audio book chapters, and jukebox "
"tracks resume automatically from where you left off - jukebox folders even "
"pick up on the last track you were playing - with adjustable pitch-"
"preserving playback speed and independent pitch-shift (semitone transpose). "
"Playback is handled by BASS, with support for volume control, audio effects, "
"output device selection, and simultaneous audio mirroring to a second "
"device. Additional features include instant and scheduled recording, time-"
"shift rewind of live radio, sleep and alarm timers, automatic ICY metadata "
"announcements, Shazam-based music recognition, and a liked-songs log with "
"lyrics lookup. All controls and shortcuts are designed for NVDA "
"accessibility."
msgstr ""
"自由之声（freeAudio） 是一款专为 NVDA 设计的网络电台、播客、有声书与本地音乐插件，通过 Radio Browser "
"开放目录、RSS/Atom 播客订阅源、面向视障人士的 libriVox + GETEM "
"数字图书馆，以及内置点唱机播放您的本地音频文件和文件夹，为您提供无缝访问数千个网络电台的便捷体验。它配备了完全无障碍的电台浏览器，支持搜索、国家/地区筛选、收藏夹管理，以及针对单个电台、单个播客、单个有声书和单个点唱机音轨的个性化音频配置文件。播客单集、有声书章节和点唱机音轨均可自动从上次中断的位置恢复播放——点唱机文件夹甚至能自动定位到您最后播放的那首音轨——并支持可调节的音高保持播放速度以及独立的音调调节（半音阶转调）。播放核心由 BASS 驱动，支持音量控制、音频特效、输出设备选择以及向第二台设备同时进行音频镜像输出。其他功能包括即时录制与定时录制、直播电台时移倒回、睡眠定时器与闹钟、自动 ICY 元数据播报、基于 Shazam 的音乐识别，以及带有歌词查询功能的红心收藏歌曲日志。所有控件和快捷键均专为 NVDA 无障碍操作而设计。"

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version
#: buildVars.py:26
msgid ""
"\n"
"## Changelog for 2026.25.3\n"
"\n"
"- Compatible with NVDA 2026.3.\n"
"\n"
"### New\n"
"- Added global shortcuts that work while the freeAudio window is closed:\n"
"\n"
"  - Ctrl+Win+F3 / Ctrl+Win+F4: previous / next item.\n"
"  - Ctrl+Win+Shift+F3 / Ctrl+Win+Shift+F4: previous / next group.\n"
"- What they do depends on what is playing:\n"
"  - Radio station: previous / next station (the Shift variants do the "
"same).\n"
"  - Podcast: previous / next episode; with Shift, previous / next feed.\n"
"  - Audio book: previous / next book; with Shift, previous / next part.\n"
"  - Jukebox: previous / next track; with Shift, previous / next library "
"entry.\n"
"- If nothing is playing, the keys are passed through to Windows unchanged.\n"
"- Audio book library entries now appear in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog "
"under \"freeAudio Audio Books\", so you can assign a shortcut to any book.\n"
"\n"
"### Improved\n"
"- Automatic track and part advance keeps working after a manual skip, with "
"the window open or closed.\n"
"- Pressing \"next\" on the last track of a jukebox folder no longer resets "
"the folder's saved position.\n"
"- With the window open, skipping an audio book from the keyboard keeps the "
"window's \"now playing\" state in sync, so its own auto-advance continues "
"from the right part.\n"
"\n"
"### Fixed\n"
"- F3/F4 and Ctrl+Left/Right on the Jukebox tab now play the track as part of "
"its folder. Previously this stopped automatic advance to the next track.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"## 自由之声 2026.25.3 版本新增内容\n"
"\n"
"- 兼容 NVDA 2026.3。\n"
"\n"
"### 新功能\n"
"- 新增全局快捷键，即使自由之声窗口关闭也可使用：\n"
"\n"
"  - Ctrl+Win+F3 / Ctrl+Win+F4：上一项 / 下一项。\n"
"  - Ctrl+Win+Shift+F3 / Ctrl+Win+Shift+F4：上一组 / 下一组。\n"
"- 它们的功能取决于当前正在播放的内容：\n"
"  - 电台：上一个 / 下一个电台（带 Shift 的组合键效果相同）。\n"
"  - 播客：上一集 / 下一集；按住 Shift 时为上一个 / 下一个订阅源。\n"
"  - 有声读物：上一本 / 下一本；按住 Shift 时为上一部分 / 下一部分。\n"
"  - 点唱机：上一首 / 下一首；按住 Shift 时为上一个 / 下一个库条目。\n"
"- 如果没有正在播放的内容，按键将原样传递给 Windows。\n"
"- 有声读物库中的条目现在会显示在 NVDA 的“输入手势”对话框中的“自由之声有声读物”类别下，因此您可以为任意一本书分配快捷键。\n"
"\n"
"### 改进\n"
"- 手动跳转后，自动切换到下一首曲目或下一部分的功能仍然有效，无论窗口是打开还是关闭。\n"
"- 在点唱机文件夹的最后一首曲目上按“下一个”，不再重置该文件夹已保存的位置。\n"
"- 窗口打开时，通过键盘跳转有声读物会使窗口中的“正在播放”状态保持同步，因此其自动切换会从正确的部分继续。\n"
"\n"
"### 修复\n"
"- 在“点唱机”选项卡中，F3/F4 和 Ctrl+左箭头/右箭头现在会将曲目作为其所在文件夹的一部分来播放。此前这会中断自动切换到下一首曲目。\n"

